- `crates/thegn-svc/src/share/mod.rs` and `share/tests.rs` are byte identical to the approved THE-326 final (`1502b5f7…`, `59f0d738…`). Typed FRP serialization, deny-unknown-fields round-trip, pre-resolution validation, token resolver ordering, and redacted plan debug remain unchanged.
